<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ 84-day T-bills yield 6.908 pct at tender.</title>
<headline>NZ 84-day T-bills yield 6.908 pct at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average yield for NZ$75 million of 84-day treasury bills at Tuesday's tender was 6.908 percent versus 6.864 percent for a similar maturity at last week's tender, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>Bids totalled NZ$325 million.</p>
